  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vietnam &#x2013; Australia Human Resource Development (Aus4Skills) Phase 3, 2025 -2035</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aus4Skills Phase 3 aims to support Vietnam to realise its human resources development goals in agreed sectors, promoting a stable, secure and prosperous Vietnam.
 
Aus4SkiIls aligns with Australian Government development priorities through its focus on climate change, energy transition, gender equality, disability and social inclusion.
 
Aus4SkilIs will build on and consolidate Australia&apos;s longstanding support for Vietnam&apos;s higher education and skills system in sectors that are drivers of inclusive economic growth, including logistics, digital transformation and the green economy. It will strengthen Vietnam&apos;s public sector leadership capability, support Australia&apos;s alumni to contribute to Vietnam&apos;s development and promote deeper relationships between Australia and Vietnam
 
Through a managing contractor, the program modalities include technical assistance, research and skills development, knowledge exchange, scholarships and sector-specific training.</narrative>
  </description>
